From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Ludovic Henry <git@ludovic.dev>
Date: Thu, 15 Oct 2026 23:50:17 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Ship AGPLv3.md in wheel metadata

pyproject.toml declares license = "AGPL-3.0-or-later" but the
repository's licence text lives at AGPLv3.md, a name the default
LICEN[CS]E*/COPYING*/NOTICE*/AUTHORS* glob does not match, so maturin
ships no licence file in the wheel at all (verified against the real
PyPI 3.0.2 release: no dist-info/licenses/ entry). Add an explicit
license-files entry so it is bundled.

Upstream-Status: To upstream [not submitted from this automated port run]
---
 pyproject.toml | 1 +
 1 file changed, 1 insertion(+)

diff --git a/pyproject.toml b/pyproject.toml
index 12ead2a..d6c8365 100644
--- a/pyproject.toml
+++ b/pyproject.toml
@@ -17,6 +17,7 @@ authors = [
 ]
 readme = "README.md"
 license = "AGPL-3.0-or-later"
+license-files = ["AGPLv3.md"]
 
 
 [project.urls]
